guide forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater
title Un'Goro Crater
faction Alliance
levels 49-51
zone Un'Goro Crater
next forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes
pitch For characters of 49 to 51, but most quests here are level 51-53: on purpose, for their experience. This first visit keeps to the crater's eastern half, where the beasts are 48-52, so pull them one at a time; the pylons, the bones, the hive and Shizzle's scales wait for the later Un'Goro visit at about 56.

# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# The Tanaris guide's Dunemaul Compound (5863) and Thistleshrub Valley (2605, 3362) are done on this guide's Gadgetzan
# landing, at about 49.5 (their mobs are 46-50), and so is the Noxious Lair chain (82, 10, 110, 113, 162: Centipaar
# 48-50, two over players on the Tanaris guide at about 47; Rise of the Silithid goes to Gracina on the Burning Steppes
# guide's Darnassus stop).
# Fix round 1 (0.4.0): this first Un'Goro visit takes Torwa, the raft, Muigin's petals and the power crystals at
# 49-50, with no top-up to 51; the pylons (4285, 4287, 4288), Shizzle's Flyer (4503), the bones and the expedition
# (3881, 3882, 3883) and A-Me 01 (4243) are taken and done on the Western Plaguelands guide's Un'Goro visit at about 57:
# their Frenzied Pterrordax (51-54), Elder Diemetradons (53-55), Glutinous Oozes (52-54) and Gorishi (51-54) were two
# to four over players here.

step Fly to Menethil Harbor
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Menethil Harbor"
  zone Wetlands

step Boat to Theramore
  zone Wetlands
  goto 5.13,63.61 "Boat to Theramore"

step Theramore
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Privateer Groy stands on the docks where the boat lands.
  turnin 623                          -- Privateer Groy

step Fly to Gadgetzan
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  goto 67.5,51.2 "Theramore flight master"
  fly "Gadgetzan"
  zone Tanaris

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Gadgetzan

step Gadgetzan
  zone Tanaris
  tip The flight from Theramore lands in Gadgetzan.
  turnin 2941

step Gadgetzan
  when group 2944
  accept 2944

step The Noxious Lair
  zone Tanaris
  tip Ride west to the Centipaar hive in the dunes. Any Centipaar can drop insect parts.
  tip Careful: Centipaar Swarmers cast Silithid Swarm both in and out of combat, which brings small adds that interrupt you.
  collect 8587 quest 82               -- Centipaar Insect Parts

step Dunemaul Compound
  zone Tanaris
  tip Ride south to the ogre compound. Brutes and Enforcers (46-48) fill it; Gor'marok the Ravager (49) stands in the middle with guards around him: clear them first.
  kill 5474 quest 5863                -- Dunemaul Brute
  kill 5472 quest 5863                -- Dunemaul Enforcer
  kill 12046 x1 quest 5863            -- Gor'marok the Ravager, below ground

step Thistleshrub Valley: kill these as you meet them
  zone Tanaris
  tip Ride west into Thistleshrub Valley. The Dew Collectors drop the glands; only some are full, so keep the Laden one. Gnarled Thistleshrubs and Rootshapers share the valley.
  tip Careful: the thistleshrubs wander a lot, so you can easily pull extra mobs.
  collect 8428 x1 quest 2605          -- Laden Dew Gland
  kill 5485 quest 3362                -- Thistleshrub Rootshaper
  kill 5490 quest 3362                -- Gnarled Thistleshrub

step Gadgetzan
  tip Ride back north-east to Gadgetzan: Andi Lynn stands on the east side of town.
  turnin 5863                         -- Andi Lynn
  turnin 2605                         -- Marin Noggenfogger
  accept 2606
  turnin 3362                         -- Tran'rek
  turnin 2606                         -- Sprinkle
  turnin 82                           -- Alchemist Pestlezugg, inside
  accept 10                           -- Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser

step The Gaping Chasm
  tip Ride south past the Broken Pillar to the Gaping Chasm, the Hazzali tunnels; Scrimshank's gear lies deep inside.
  tip Careful: One bug guards the gear. Many bugs patrol the tunnels, some of them level 50, so fights often pull extra adds.
  collect 8593 x1 quest 10            -- Scrimshank's Surveying Gear; below ground

step Gadgetzan
  turnin 10                           -- Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser
  accept 110
  turnin 110                          -- Alchemist Pestlezugg, inside
  accept 113
  turnin 113                          -- Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser
  accept 162                          -- For Gracina Spiritmight in Darnassus, at the end of the Burning Steppes guide: keep it

step Un'Goro Crater
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  goto 71.6,76.0 "Torwa Pathfinder"

step Torwa Pathfinder
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Ride west out of Gadgetzan to the long ramp down into Un'Goro Crater. Torwa camps at the foot of the ramp, in the south-east corner of the crater.
  accept 4290

step Fresh Threshadon Carcass
  tip The dead Threshadon lies by the water north of Torwa.
  tip Careful: Venomhide Ravasaurs (50-51) hunt along the water there: pull them one at a time before you loot the carcass.
  tip Any ravasaur may drop a Crystal Infused Scale: right-click it, Torwa takes it.
  collect 11504 quest 4290            -- Piece of Threshadon Carcass
  collect 280459 x1 optional          -- Crystal Infused Scale
  accept 87494 optional

step Torwa Pathfinder
  turnin 4290
  turnin 87494 optional               -- Microcrystal Contamination, if a ravasaur dropped the scale
  accept 4291
  accept 4289                         -- The gorillas on Ironstone Plateau carry the pelts: keep it for the second Un'Goro visit, around 56

step Lar'korwi Mates and the raft
  tip The Lar'korwi Mates prowl the jungle west of Torwa. The wrecked raft lies on the shore of the lake there; the small pack sits in the water beside it. Keep the compass, map and key for Linken. Any beast in the crater may drop A Mangled Journal: right-click it.
  collect 11509 quest 4291            -- Ravasaur Pheromone Gland
  accept 3844                         -- A Wrecked Raft
  turnin 3844                         -- A Small Pack, underwater
  accept 3845
  collect 11104 quest 3845 @63.1,69.1
  collect 11105 quest 3845 @63.1,69.1
  collect 11106 quest 3845 @63.1,69.1
  collect 11116 x1 optional           -- A Mangled Journal
  accept 3884 optional

step Marshal's Refuge
  tip Ride west back to the refuge.
  tip Give the elite devilsaurs and stegodons a wide berth. Pick up every Power Crystal and Un'Goro Dirt Pile you pass from here on.
  accept 4141                         -- Muigin
  getfp "Marshal's Refuge"            -- Gryfe
  turnin 3884 optional                -- Williden Marshal
  turnin 3845                         -- Linken, at the back of the refuge
  accept 3908                         -- Ends with Donova Snowden in Winterspring: keep it
  accept 4284                         -- J.D. Collie, at the back of the cave; below ground
  note Shizzle, Spark Nilminer, Hol'anyee Marshal, Williden Marshal and Karna Remtravel have quests among mobs of 51-55: leave them for the later Un'Goro visit, at about 56.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The eastern jungle and the crystals

step Fire Plume Ridge and the eastern jungle
  tip Ride east into the eastern jungle: Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers (48-50) drop the petals and Un'Goro Soil. Crystal clusters stand all over the crater, many around the foot of Fire Plume Ridge: take a few extra of each colour.
  tip Careful: the Living Blazes (54-55) walk the top of Fire Plume Ridge, and the Bloodpetal Flayers and Trappers (51-53) hold the jungle's south: take your crystals from the ridge's foot and your petals in the north.
  collect 11316 quest 4141            -- Bloodpetal
  collect 11018 quest 3764            -- Un'Goro Soil

step Lakkari Tar Pits
  tip The Tar Beasts (50-51) wallow at the pits' edge; the Tar Lords (53-54) further in: take the crystals around the edge.
  collect 11184 quest 4284            -- Blue Power Crystal
  collect 11185 quest 4284            -- Green Power Crystal
  collect 11186 quest 4284            -- Red Power Crystal
  collect 11188 quest 4284            -- Yellow Power Crystal

step Marshal's Refuge
  turnin 4284                         -- J.D. Collie, below ground
  turnin 4141                         -- Muigin
  accept 4142                         -- For Gregan Brewspewer in Feralas: keep it
  level 50 only Priest,Mage

step Level 49.79
  when level<49.79
  tip Still short of level 49.79 after the refuge's hand-ins? Top up on the Pterrordax on the slopes east of Marshal's Refuge before you leave the crater.
  goto 57.0,10.2 map 1449 "Pterrordax"
  level 49.79 grind 9166               -- grind on Pterrordax

step Fly to Astranaar
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Shaman,Warlock,Druid
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip The Ironforge quests were taken at the end of the Searing Gorge guide: fly straight on to Ashenvale for Azshara.
  goto 45.3,6.0 "Marshal's Refuge flight master"
  fly "Astranaar"

step To Ironforge
  only Priest,Mage
  zone Ironforge
  goto 18.15,51.45 "Stonefire Tavern"

